{"2827640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mimi's Pet Rescue", "steam_appid": 2827640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/5cfbc649d208b2fcb54e70a793c75211.avif?t=1787162413\" width=540 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're hired! <strong>Mimi’s Animal Rescue</strong> is a cute, cozy animal sanctuary simulation game where your aim is to provide care and support for a variety of injured and lost animals. Welcome lost, injured and abandoned animals into your new animal rescue centre by helping each new arrival feel safe, comfortable and ready to begin their journey towards a happier life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/a33cb73dc95155cd0a5d6a6ee336533c.poster.avif?t=1787162413\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/a33cb73dc95155cd0a5d6a6ee336533c.webm?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/a33cb73dc95155cd0a5d6a6ee336533c.mp4?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/637105eb5cbed366c5ee812ba465c713.avif?t=1787162413\" width=540 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every animal has their own personality, preferences and little quirks. Learn what makes them happy, provide their favourite foods and give them the attention they need to thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/c9f43b4421acbcafa0b447197b8c709c.poster.avif?t=1787162413\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/c9f43b4421acbcafa0b447197b8c709c.webm?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/c9f43b4421acbcafa0b447197b8c709c.mp4?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/e0b7b678ee4e64013e84d88fdb73827f.avif?t=1787162413\" width=540 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wash muddy paws, brush tangled fur and treat illnesses and injuries. With patience and care, you can help every rescue recover and return to full health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/ddd3a4406b7726e57d6da3ce4dbc66af.poster.avif?t=1787162413\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/ddd3a4406b7726e57d6da3ce4dbc66af.webm?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/ddd3a4406b7726e57d6da3ce4dbc66af.mp4?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/f238fd642828816dcb648230994368c0.avif?t=1787162413\" width=540 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a cosy home for your animals with comfortable beds, playful spaces and colourful decorations. Make every room feel safe, cheerful and full of character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/2f686bc5031388390e9bc7e9d24936dd.poster.avif?t=1787162413\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/2f686bc5031388390e9bc7e9d24936dd.webm?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/2f686bc5031388390e9bc7e9d24936dd.mp4?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/e2106b90c0cda01108bfa7fc1d701d23.avif?t=1787162413\" width=540 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an animal is healthy and ready, match them with a suitable adopter. Saying goodbye is never easy, but watching a beloved pet leave for their new home makes every moment worthwhile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/e7d9ad285159c633796515ef24482b2a.poster.avif?t=1787162413\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/e7d9ad285159c633796515ef24482b2a.webm?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/e7d9ad285159c633796515ef24482b2a.mp4?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/5cfbc649d208b2fcb54e70a793c75211.avif?t=1787162413\" width=540 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're hired! <strong>Mimi’s Animal Rescue</strong> is a cute, cozy animal sanctuary simulation game where your aim is to provide care and support for a variety of injured and lost animals. Welcome lost, injured and abandoned animals into your new animal rescue centre by helping each new arrival feel safe, comfortable and ready to begin their journey towards a happier life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/a33cb73dc95155cd0a5d6a6ee336533c.poster.avif?t=1787162413\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/a33cb73dc95155cd0a5d6a6ee336533c.webm?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/a33cb73dc95155cd0a5d6a6ee336533c.mp4?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/637105eb5cbed366c5ee812ba465c713.avif?t=1787162413\" width=540 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every animal has their own personality, preferences and little quirks. Learn what makes them happy, provide their favourite foods and give them the attention they need to thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/c9f43b4421acbcafa0b447197b8c709c.poster.avif?t=1787162413\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/c9f43b4421acbcafa0b447197b8c709c.webm?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/c9f43b4421acbcafa0b447197b8c709c.mp4?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/e0b7b678ee4e64013e84d88fdb73827f.avif?t=1787162413\" width=540 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wash muddy paws, brush tangled fur and treat illnesses and injuries. With patience and care, you can help every rescue recover and return to full health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/ddd3a4406b7726e57d6da3ce4dbc66af.poster.avif?t=1787162413\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/ddd3a4406b7726e57d6da3ce4dbc66af.webm?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/ddd3a4406b7726e57d6da3ce4dbc66af.mp4?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/f238fd642828816dcb648230994368c0.avif?t=1787162413\" width=540 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a cosy home for your animals with comfortable beds, playful spaces and colourful decorations. Make every room feel safe, cheerful and full of character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/2f686bc5031388390e9bc7e9d24936dd.poster.avif?t=1787162413\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/2f686bc5031388390e9bc7e9d24936dd.webm?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/2f686bc5031388390e9bc7e9d24936dd.mp4?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/e2106b90c0cda01108bfa7fc1d701d23.avif?t=1787162413\" width=540 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an animal is healthy and ready, match them with a suitable adopter. Saying goodbye is never easy, but watching a beloved pet leave for their new home makes every moment worthwhile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/e7d9ad285159c633796515ef24482b2a.poster.avif?t=1787162413\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/e7d9ad285159c633796515ef24482b2a.webm?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/extras/e7d9ad285159c633796515ef24482b2a.mp4?t=1787162413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Manage an animal sanctuary where your job is to rescue abandoned pets and find them a new home! Rescue lost animals and nurse them back to health in our cozy pet rescue simulator. Stock the shop, organise events, watch pets bond with customers and get your pets ready to be adopted for a better life!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/231e8efd82b0483163cc9fe92ca1d5d7dc31a190/header.jpg?t=1787162413", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/bfe3a1d01b5113aa2cff7c9bba67bb0f64f88cdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787162413", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827640/bfe3a1d01b5113aa2cff7c9bba67bb0f64f88cdb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787162413", "website": "https://www.derp-labs.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Geforce 1050m or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Geforce 5060 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><stro